<title>EGYPT: Egypt share index closes at record 387.92 points.</title>
<headline>Egypt share index closes at record 387.92 points.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian share prices rose 1.92 percent to close at 387.92 points on Monday, the 12th record high for the all-share index in a row, the Capital Markets Authority said.</p>
<p>It said the index rose 7.31 points from Sunday's close of 380.61.</p>
